	(text "RS485 (U701): fault-protected RS-485 port"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c3e4dff1-811b-5cb3-9381-857e2e1c4633")
	)
	(text_box "WHAT IT DOES\nAn RS-485 port for meters, sensors and controllers on a two-wire bus (A, B). U701 turns the ESP32 UART (3.3 V logic) into the\ndifferential bus signal and back; half duplex, so RS485_DE switches it between sending and receiving.\nD701 protects the bus pins; solder jumpers add the 120 ohm termination and the bias resistors when this board needs them.\n\nPINS OF THIS MODULE (its block on the top sheet)\nRS485_A (bus): J1 pin 14 (twisted pair with B; bus ground on J1 pin 2)\nRS485_B (bus): J1 pin 6\nRS485_TX (in): from ESP32 GPIO14: data to send (U701 DI)\nRS485_RX (out): to ESP32 GPIO35: data received (U701 RO)\nRS485_DE (in): from ESP32 GPIO25: high = send, low = receive\n+3V3 (in): supply from the 3.3 V regulator\nGND: ground\nPower and ground reach the parts on this sheet only through these pins: the ground and supply symbols drawn on this sheet are local to it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 17.78 0)
		(size 265 32.7)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ab5e91bc-b491-507a-8a29-d89d3509fa61")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 177.8 58.42)
		(end 215.9 124.46)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type dash)
			(color 200 60 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "5112332a-a7ad-5791-b8ce-dc62fa66388d")
	)
	(text "keep together on the PCB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 178.4 59.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a1182fcf-fc29-5811-ae8b-f9bd44896630")
	)
	(text "C701 belongs to U701 pin 8 (VCC): within 2 mm\nof that pin, GND via beside its GND pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20339222-2fd0-5851-bd1c-ca3c8284644f")
	)
	(text "D701 is the first part after J1\n(pins 14 and 6): place it right at\nthe connector."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 78.74 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c9903db8-253c-5b1d-b29c-567b20d34a3f")
	)
	(text "Bias: bridge JP703 AND JP704,\non one node of the bus only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "36db7500-415a-50f9-81eb-1f26295704d7")
	)
	(text "Termination: bridge JP702 only\nat the two ends of the bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 93.98 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "90fbe373-4b80-59bd-a62a-5d2ccc1a667d")
	)
	(text_box "PARTS AND THEIR JOBS\nU701: THVD2410 half-duplex RS-485 transceiver, 3.3 V, up to 500 kbit/s (drawn with the SP3485 symbol, same pinout, mirrored so A/B face J1). A and B survive +/-70 V and work over +/-25 V common mode: a bus wire on 12 V or 24 V does no damage.\nC701: 100 nF decoupling for U701 VCC (pin 8). Must sit at pin 8 on the PCB.\nD701: SZNUP3105L bus protector (the CAN port's part): clamps surges on A and B to GND. 32 V working voltage, off on a 24 V system.\nR701: 10k pull-up on RS485_RX: RO floats while U701 sends, R701 keeps the ESP32 input high (idle).\nR702: 10k pull-up on RS485_TX: keeps the driver input idle (high) while the ESP32 resets.\nR703: 10k pull-down on RS485_DE: keeps U701 receiving (driver off) while the ESP32 resets or boots.\nR704, JP702: 120 ohm termination across A-B, only with JP702 (TERM) bridged: bridge it on the two nodes at the bus ends.\nR705, JP703, R706, JP704: 330 ohm bias: A to 3.3 V and B to GND with JP703 + JP704 bridged; on one node of the bus only.\nJumpers: JP702-JP704 are solder jumpers, open as delivered: no termination and no bias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 156 0)
		(size 155 26.55)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d74abcdd-62d8-56c0-9678-868fbd5c6b98")
	)
